      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i know, i've heard the \"talk to someone\" thing a million times. it just feels so pointless. like, what's the point of working through it when there's nothing actually \"wrong\" to fix? i'm not even depressed in the way people think, i'm just... gone. i look at my life and i just feel this massive, heavy stillness. i just want the noise of trying to feel something to finally stop. i just want peace.",
