      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so quiet. like, even when i'm around people, there's this permanent silence in my head. it's not even like i'm suffering anymore, it's just that there's nothing there. and honestly, sometimes i look at the stillness and think... wouldn't it be easier if it was just permanent? if the grayness just stopped for good? it feels like the only logical way to actually get that peace i'm looking for.",
